# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
config RUST_IRQ_CORE
	bool "Rust interrupt descriptor, dispatch and irqchip core"
	depends on RUST
	default y
	help
	  Select Rust ownership of irqdesc.c, handle.c and chip.c. Configured
	  native layouts are generated from the original kernel headers. The
	  compiler primitive and registration companion contains no original
	  C owner bodies. Sparse and flat descriptor modes, SMP affinity,
	  domain hierarchy, SYSFS and statistics retain their native branches.
	  Existing C IRQ/KUnit tests link against the selected Rust symbols.
	  Disabling this option selects the unchanged original C providers.
